Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:04:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/14] media: add Ingenic display, camera and audio drivers

Port the X1000 SLCD DRM, CIM camera, JPEG encoder, internal codec and AIC audio support, plus the lightweight X1501 audio interface, ST7735S framebuffer and AW2023 LED compatibility.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
